{"id": "UgzTxMPiOEtRQ3usD6p4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 2, "text": "오늘도 무사히 행운를. 기원합니다❤🎉", "published": "2026-07-16T22:09:43", "replies": 1, "creator": false}
